---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contribute — AI Governance Toolkit"
  description="How to contribute templates, sector packs, or improvements."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-700">Contribute</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-semibold text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight text-ink-900 mt-2">Contribute to the toolkit</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-prose-wide mt-8">
      <p>Especially valued:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>AI Governance leads with field experience submitting sector packs (Banking, Healthcare, Insurance, Public sector).</li>
        <li>ISO/IEC SC 42 participants reviewing clause mappings.</li>
        <li>Template improvements rooted in actual deployments.</li>
        <li>Translations of AIIA questions into other languages.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>How to submit</h2>
      <p>Open a PR at <a href="https://github.com/emmanuelgjr/AI-Governance-Toolkit">github.com/emmanuelgjr/AI-Governance-Toolkit</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
